<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-R&amp;I net profit rises in 1995/96.</title>
<headline>RTRS-R&amp;I net profit rises in 1995/96.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>	    (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		  4.70 vs   1.11</p>
<p>    Net profit			  3.93 vs   0.70</p>
<p>    Sales			     118.49 vs  63.24</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		   nil vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Resource and Industry Ltd is an investment group after it sold its grocery retail operations in July.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
</text>
